sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant MM as Mix & Match (CherMode.jsx)
  participant GW as API gateway (auth)
  participant CH as Cher feature (studio/features/cher.js)
  participant CS as CompatibilityService
  participant EN as Recommendation engine
  participant WR as Wardrobe / Profile / Weather
  U->>MM: Spin (occasion, locks, rediscovery)
  MM->>GW: POST /api/v1/cher-mode/spin
  GW->>CH: spin(userId, body)
  CH->>WR: allPieces(userId), preferences, forecast
  CH->>CS: enumerateOutfits(Available pieces, locked, modest, dress code)
  CS->>EN: filterPieces · combine · criteria · breakdown
  EN-->>CS: candidate looks + rule scores
  CS-->>CH: valid looks (score ≥ 66)
  CH->>CH: weighted pick w = (score/100)^8 × (1 + 3·forgotten)
  CH-->>MM: outfit, score, reasons, verdict, rings
  MM->>MM: rings turn to returned pieces (stagger 0.4 s)
  U->>MM: Try it on / Fine-tune / Spin again
  MM->>GW: POST /api/v1/cher-mode/feedback (accepted · fine_tuned · rejected)
